# Kyomi v1.0 - Comprehensive Manual Testing Checklist

**Generated:** 2025-11-17
**Purpose:** Complete feature testing guide for pre-production release
**Testing Environments:**
- Desktop: Chrome, Firefox, Safari (1920x1080)
- Tablet: iPad/Android (768x1024)
- Mobile: iPhone/Android (375x812)

---

## Testing Instructions

### Priority Levels
- 🔴 **CRITICAL** - Must work for v1.0 launch (core functionality)
- 🟡 **HIGH** - Important but not blocking (quality features)
- 🟢 **MEDIUM** - Nice to have, test if time permits

### Device Testing Legend
- **Desktop** - Test on desktop browsers only
- **Mobile** - Test on mobile devices only
- **Both** - Test on both desktop and mobile

---

